# ThreadSanitizer suppression file for Charybdis.
#
# Format: race:symbol_pattern  or  called_from_lib:library_name
# Reference: https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/ThreadSanitizerSuppressions
#
# This file is intentionally empty. Suppressions are added only in
# response to an observed TSan CI failure, per docs/tsan-triage.md.
# Each entry MUST be preceded by a comment recording:
#   - failing test name
#   - CI run URL
#   - ISO-8601 date
#   - rationale for why the race is benign
#   - upstream issue link (if any)
#
# Do not add speculative entries. An empty suppressions file is the
# correct state until the TSan job surfaces a real false positive.
